(d)
"examining body" means a University, agency or authority to which an institution is affiliated for conducting examinations
in teacher education qualifications;
(e)
"institution" means an institution which offers courses or training in teacher education;
(ea)
[ "local authority" means a Municipal Corporation, Municipal Committee, Municipal Council, Zila Parishad, District Board
